@startuml seq_login
title Sequence Diagram - Login
actor User
boundary "Halaman Login (UI)" as UI
control "NextAuth API" as Auth
entity "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Memasukkan Email dan Password
UI -> Auth: POST /api/auth/callback/credentials
Auth -> DB: Cari User berdasarkan Email
DB --> Auth: Data User
Auth -> Auth: Verifikasi Password (Bcrypt)
Auth -> DB: Catat Session
Auth --> UI: Mengembalikan Session Token
UI --> User: Redirect ke Halaman Dashboard
@enduml

@startuml seq_assign_tiket
title Sequence Diagram - Assign Tiket
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Detail Tiket (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Notification Service" as Notif

IT -> UI: Pilih Nama Rekan pada Dropdown "Penerima Tugas"
UI -> API: PUT /api/tickets/[id]/assign {assigneeId}
API -> DB: Update field Assignee & ubah Status jadi "In Progress"
DB --> API: Data Tiket Diperbarui
API -> DB: Buat Notifikasi In-App untuk Assignee
API -> Notif: Kirim Email & WA ke Assignee
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> IT: Tampilkan Pop-up (Toast) Sukses
@enduml

@startuml seq_kelola_kb
title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Knowledge Base
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Form KB (UI)" as UI
control "Knowledge Base API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

IT -> UI: Isi Judul, Kategori, Konten, Lampiran
IT -> UI: Klik "Simpan Artikel"
UI -> API: POST /api/knowledge
API -> DB: Insert Data Artikel Baru
DB --> API: Artikel Tersimpan
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> IT: Tampilkan Pesan Sukses & Redirect ke Daftar KB
@enduml

@startuml seq_kelola_ahp
title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Kriteria AHP
actor "Admin (IT)" as Admin
boundary "Pengaturan AHP (UI)" as UI
control "AHP API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

Admin -> UI: Buka Menu Konfigurasi AHP
UI -> API: GET /api/ahp/criteria
API -> DB: Ambil Kriteria yang Ada
DB --> API: Data Kriteria
API --> UI: Tampilkan Kriteria
Admin -> UI: Edit Kriteria & Isi Matriks Perbandingan Saaty (1-9)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Hitung Bobot AHP"
UI -> UI: Kalkulasi Eigenvector & Consistency Ratio (CR)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Simpan Konfigurasi AHP" (Bila CR <= 0.1)
UI -> API: POST /api/ahp/criteria {kriteria, bobot}
API -> DB: Hapus Kriteria Lama & Insert Kriteria Baru
DB --> API: Tersimpan
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan Pop-up Sukses
@enduml

@startuml seq_kelola_pengguna
title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Pengguna
actor "Admin (IT)" as Admin
boundary "Kelola Pengguna (UI)" as UI
control "User API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

Admin -> UI: Klik "Add User" / "Edit"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan Modal Form
Admin -> UI: Isi Form (NIK, Nama, Email, Password, Role, Lokasi)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Create User" / "Update User"
UI -> API: POST /api/users/create (atau PUT)
API -> DB: Validasi & Insert/Update Data Pengguna
DB --> API: Data Tersimpan
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> Admin: Tutup Modal & Tampilkan Toast Sukses
@enduml

@startuml seq_komentar
title Sequence Diagram - Komentar dan Lampiran
actor "Pengguna (SPV/IT)" as User
boundary "Detail Tiket (UI)" as UI
control "Comment API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Notification Service" as Notif

User -> UI: Ketik Pesan & Upload Lampiran
User -> UI: Klik "Kirim"
UI -> API: POST /api/tickets/[id]/comments
API -> DB: Simpan Komentar & Link Lampiran
DB --> API: Data Komentar
API -> Notif: Kirim Notifikasi Email ke Pembuat/Penerima Tiket
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> User: Tampilkan Komentar Baru di Chat
@enduml

@startuml seq_melihat_shift
title Sequence Diagram - Melihat Kalender Shift
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Kalender Shift (UI)" as UI
control "Schedule API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

IT -> UI: Akses Menu "Kalender Shift"
UI -> API: GET /api/schedule/monthly
API -> DB: Ambil Data Shift Bulan Berjalan
DB --> API: Daftar Shift (Pagi, Siang, Malam)
API --> UI: Data Shift JSON
UI --> IT: Render Jadwal pada FullCalendar
@enduml

@startuml seq_semua_tiket
title Sequence Diagram - Melihat Semua Tiket
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Dashboard Dept (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

IT -> UI: Akses Menu Departemen IT
UI -> API: GET /api/tickets (Filter departemen/semua)
API -> DB: Ambil Semua Tiket
DB --> API: Daftar Tiket Lengkap
API --> UI: Data Tiket JSON
UI --> IT: Render Data Table (Terbuka, Diproses, Selesai)
@enduml

@startuml seq_tiket_saya
title Sequence Diagram - Melihat Tiket Saya
actor "Pengguna (SPV/IT)" as User
boundary "Tugas Saya (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Akses Menu "Tiket Saya" / "Tugas Saya"
UI -> API: GET /api/tickets (Filter creatorId=me atau assigneeId=me)
API -> DB: Ambil Tiket terkait User
DB --> API: Daftar Tiket
API --> UI: Data Tiket JSON
UI --> User: Render Data Table Tiket
@enduml

@startuml seq_baca_kb
title Sequence Diagram - Membaca Knowledge Base
actor "Pengguna (SPV/IT)" as User
boundary "Knowledge Base (UI)" as UI
control "Knowledge Base API" as API
entity "Database" as DB

User -> UI: Akses Menu Knowledge Base & Ketik Kata Kunci
UI -> API: GET /api/knowledge?search=keyword
API -> DB: Cari Artikel sesuai Kata Kunci
DB --> API: Hasil Pencarian
API --> UI: Data Artikel
UI --> User: Tampilkan Daftar Artikel / Detail Artikel
@enduml

@startuml seq_buat_tiket
title Sequence Diagram - Membuat Tiket
actor "Supervisor Shop" as SPV
boundary "Form Buat Tiket (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Notification Service" as Notif

SPV -> UI: Isi Judul, Deskripsi, Lampiran
SPV -> UI: Isi Kuesioner AHP (Dampak, Urgensi, dll)
UI -> UI: Kalkulasi Prediksi Prioritas (Skor AHP)
UI --> SPV: Tampilkan Prediksi Prioritas (e.g., HIGH)
SPV -> UI: Klik "Buat Tiket"
UI -> API: POST /api/tickets/create {data, ahpScores}
API -> UI: Validasi Data
API -> DB: Hitung Ulang & Insert Tiket Baru
DB --> API: Tiket Dibuat
API -> DB: Insert Notifikasi Lonceng untuk SPV
API -> Notif: Kirim Email ke SPV (Konfirmasi) & IT Support
API --> UI: Response Sukses & ID Tiket
UI --> SPV: Redirect ke Detail Tiket & Toast Sukses
@enduml

@startuml seq_terima_notifikasi
title Sequence Diagram - Menerima Notifikasi
actor "Pengguna (SPV/IT)" as User
boundary "Email Client / Browser" as Client
control "Sistem Ticketing" as System
entity "Database" as DB

System -> DB: Event Terjadi (Tiket Baru/Status/Assign)
System -> DB: Simpan Notifikasi In-App
System -> Client: Kirim Email Notifikasi
Client --> User: Muncul Pop-up Email Baru
User -> Client: Buka Email & Klik "Cek Detail Lengkap"
Client -> System: Buka URL Tiket di Browser
System --> User: Tampilkan Detail Tiket Terkait
@enduml

@startuml seq_tutup_tiket
title Sequence Diagram - Menutup Tiket
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Detail Tiket (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Notification Service" as Notif

IT -> UI: Pilih Status "Resolved" atau "Closed" di Dropdown
UI -> API: PUT /api/tickets/[id]/status {status: "CLOSED"}
API -> DB: Update Status Tiket & Timestamp
DB --> API: Data Tiket Diperbarui
API -> DB: Buat Notifikasi In-App (Tiket Ditutup)
API -> Notif: Kirim Notifikasi Email/WA ke SPV
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> IT: Toast Sukses, Tiket Selesai
@enduml

@startuml seq_tukar_shift
title Sequence Diagram - Tukar Shift
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Tukar Shift (UI)" as UI
control "Schedule API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Email Service" as Email

IT -> UI: Akses Menu "Tukar Shift"
IT -> UI: Isi Data Diri, Data Rekan, dan Alasan
IT -> UI: Klik "Ajukan Permintaan Tukar Shift"
UI -> API: POST /api/schedule/swap
API -> DB: Insert Pengajuan Tukar (Status: PENDING)
DB --> API: Tersimpan
API -> DB: Insert Notifikasi In-App untuk Rekan Target
API -> Email: Kirim Email Notifikasi ke Rekan Target
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> IT: Tampilkan Toast Sukses
@enduml

@startuml seq_update_status
title Sequence Diagram - Update Status Tiket
actor "IT Support" as IT
boundary "Detail Tiket (UI)" as UI
control "Ticket API" as API
entity "Database" as DB
control "Notification Service" as Notif

IT -> UI: Pilih Status (cth: In Progress, Pending) dari Dropdown
UI -> API: PUT /api/tickets/[id]/status {status}
API -> DB: Update Status Tiket di Database
DB --> API: Data Tiket Diperbarui
API -> DB: Buat Notifikasi In-App untuk SPV
API -> Notif: Kirim Notifikasi Tembusan via WA ke Admin & Email ke SPV
API --> UI: Response Sukses
UI --> IT: Tampilkan Toast Sukses
@enduml
